  "title": "Coast Guard, Local Agencies Medevac Woman from Canyon near Manzanita, Ore.",
  "description": "An MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew, from Coast Guard Air Station Astoria in Warrenton, Ore., medevacs a 52-year-old woman after she fell down a canyon 10 miles East of Manzanita, May 30, 2016. The medevac came at the request of Tillamook County Sheriff's Office personnel and ended with the helicopter crew safely transferring the woman to staff at Tillamook Regional Medical Center. U.S. Coast Guard video courtesy of Air Station Astoria.",
